.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:UltraHSTU\", \"paper:ultrahstu\"], \"executed_refs\": [], \"evidence_class\": \"agent-declared usage; not mechanism confirmation\"}, {\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-est\", \"decision\": \"rejected\", \"rationale\": \"Feature-specific FFNs are relevant as a capacity-allocation analogy, but this study isolates task-relevance hidden sharing; original paper not audited.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"No mechanism adopted from this card.\", \"variant_names\": [], \"nearest_work_difference\": \"Task-private scorer trunks rather than feature-specific FFNs in repeated cross-attention.\", \"falsifier\": \"Reconsider only if new local diagnostics identify the corresponding bottleneck, after primary-source inspection.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:EST\", \"paper:est\"], \"executed_refs\": [], \"evidence_class\": \"agent-declared usage; not mechanism confirmation\"}, {\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-tokenformer\", \"decision\": \"rejected\", \"rationale\": \"Full field/event token exchange changes multiple mechanisms and costs and does not isolate the current sharing question; original paper not read.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"No mechanism adopted from this card.\", \"variant_names\": [], \"nearest_work_difference\": \"No new full-history token stack or attention kernel.\", \"falsifier\": \"Reconsider only if new local diagnostics identify the corresponding bottleneck, after primary-source inspection.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:TokenFormer\", \"paper:tokenformer\"], \"executed_refs\": [], \"evidence_class\": \"agent-declared usage; not mechanism confirmation\"}, {\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-ssr\", \"decision\": \"rejected\", \"rationale\": \"Competitive sparse filtering is not motivated by measured activation redundancy here; no local SSR result exists.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"No mechanism adopted from this card.\", \"va