nk-method-infnet','decision':'used','rationale':'Read pinned benchmark aggregation/broadcast implementation and benchmark section2.3 after finding the local late-readout restriction. It is the nearest inspected information-flow analogy, not evidence of transfer or original-paper equivalence.','transformed_mechanism':'One strictly masked summary-to-token attention residual before the existing interaction; replace private summaries by their mean as the active matched control. No repeated multi-view hubs or affine broadcast code copied.','variant_names':names,'nearest_work_difference':'Four learned compressed task summaries inside R12 versus repeated categorical/sequence/task hub aggregation and broadcast. Original-paper novelty remains unverified.','falsifier':'Failure to beat both R12 and the mean-source control opposes added task-specific utility for this implementation.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'paper:infnet','decision':'unresolved','rationale':'Resolved provenance and attempted authorized read; original text is unavailable. Read the explicit benchmark fallback and pinned code, and retain the source-availability limitation.','transformed_mechanism':'No original-paper result or equivalence claim imported.','variant_names':[],'nearest_work_difference':'Only the benchmark implementation was checked; original priority is unverified.','falsifier':'Original-source audit could identify closer overlap; it is needed before a stronger originality claim.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'unirank-method-ultrahstu','decision':'rejected','rationale':'No measured long-sequence transduction or sparse-attention bottleneck motivates replacing the100-event representation in this contrast.','transformed_mechanism':'No mechanism adopted.','variant_names':[],'nearest_work_difference':'No event transduction, truncation or sparse attention changes.','falsifier':'Reconsider after diagnostics identify a sequence-transduction bottleneck and original-source inspection.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'unirank-method-es